# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release hygiene (2026-07-17): keep only the core platform on GitHub.
# The folders below are kept LOCALLY but shielded from git (research outputs,
# design/theory notes, the paper, dev notebooks, archived loose files).
# Each has a local README explaining its contents. To re-track, remove its
# line here and `git add`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Research outputs / scratch (local only)
result/
output/
cell/
kernel/
note/
appendix/

# Design / theory / refactor-process notes (local only; core docs link into it)
idea/

# LaTeX paper (local only; edited locally)
report/

# Relocated from repo root (see each folder's README)
notebooks/
archive/

# Internal process/planning docs (local only; agent + release workflow).
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
RELEASE_TODO.md

# AI-assistant / editor tooling config (local only)
.claude/
.codex/
